      "mergeID": "6a96ba994164b74953c7a9e9",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Lucifer MStar had mentioned this in discord and I decided to make it a canny post. With addition to the new loading screens to fix the period of \"Blackness\" people were complaining about when networking was unpacking a lot of assets which seemed like a crash, it would be nice to allow for world creators to upload a panoramic 360 image to replace the loading screen.",
